{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>ZenithPomodoro 是一款簡約美觀的專注力工具，結合番茄鐘工作法、動態背景與呼吸練習，為需要深度工作的開發者、學生和寫作者營造不受干擾的專注環境。原價 US $0.99，目前限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>核心功能特色</h2>\n<p>可自訂的專注時段、短暫休息與長休息，配合流暢的 Mesh 動態背景，以及 Midnight Rain、Lotus 等沉浸式主題，營造貼合工作氛圍。呼吸同步指引幫助你調節節奏，Dynamic Island 與即時活動讓你在鎖定畫面快速查看進度；加上工作階段標籤與歷史記錄，可深入分析專注時間分佈。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-11-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-12-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-13-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-14-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-15-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1206x2622bb-16-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：ZenithPomodoro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-24T01:21:25.745914+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}